# @APP_NAME@ FluentQt integration slice

`WorkspacePanel` is an embeddable PySide6 widget backed by native FluentQt
components. Move the application and UI modules into the matching host
packages rather than creating a parallel architecture.

```bash
python -m venv .venv
python -m pip install -e .
python -m unittest discover -s tests
@APP_ID@-panel-demo
```
